			<div style="color: #111111;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark">
<h5 style="text-align: right;"><span style="color: #111111;">Our Mission</span></h5>
<p><span style="color: #111111;"><span style="font-size: 18px;">The Salvation Army, an international movement, is an evangelical part of the universal Christian Church.​ Its message is based on the Bible. Its ministry is motivated by the love of God. Its mission is to preach the gospel of Jesus Christ and to meet human needs in His name without discrimination.</span></span></p>
</div>
			<div class="py-5"></div>
			<div class="py-5"></div>
			<div style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-secondary-200 text-light"><h5>Our Purpose</h5>

<p>
	<span style="font-size:18px;">Our purpose is to support the mission of The Salvation Army in preaching the gospel of Jesus Christ and to meet human needs in His name without discrimination. As members, we covenant ourselves to proclaim and live out the Gospel of Jesus Christ in a way that will impact our community and our world to the glory of God, by focusing <strong>UPWARD</strong>, looking <strong>INWARD</strong>, reaching <strong>OUTWARD</strong>, and moving <strong>FORWARD</strong>.​</span>
</p></div>
